  "description": "Mc, a fortune teller who can read human fate, uses chips embedded in the human finger to read their past and predict their future. As he encounters various people and gathers data, he gradually becomes more human, but he is actually a robot created for a specific purpose...!\n\nThis profound comic explores the psychological aspects of humanity's unique \"irrational side,\" winning the 2016 SF Award for \"Paranoid Android.\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
